[{"client_msg_id":"e262ebff-0e3c-4cff-a899-5e646ef10574","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"~他人の作った設定をパクるのさえ面倒くさいので自分はlualine使い続けますが。~","ts":"1630506752.023400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p=if"}]},{"client_msg_id":"300ac3b4-5d67-4bbd-bfba-a3adb8294129","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ちなみに、LuaとGalaxyのちょうど中間を取ったと自負しているプラグインならありますね。\n\u003chttps://github.com/famiu/feline.nvim\u003e","ts":"1630506332.022500","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"famiu/feline.nvim","id":1,"title":"famiu/feline.nvim","text":"A minimal, stylish and customizable statusline for Neovim written in Lua","fields":[{"title":"Stars","value":"243","short":true},{"title":"Language","value":"Lua","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PG9JD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be9a66fd-c507-45c6-b437-7e9ef75fe7e7","type":"message","user":"U01BVGM8K63","text":"lualine かなり前になにかのプラグインと相性悪くて galaxyline に乗り換えたけど未だに設定サボってます;;","ts":"1630505896.021200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gu0Qu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd454d31-84e8-4a47-a0b4-fd8e006db245","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"軽さがウリのlualine、カスタマイズ性がウリのgalaxyline","ts":"1630504249.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LrllL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8E80EE3D-CE47-468E-B3A7-F81A56E36862","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"galaxyline.nvimに手を出してしまったんですけど相当な沼","ts":"1630496847.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","UGN0T63GC","U01BVGM8K63"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MMkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30fd5d73-5a23-44f3-8eff-a2d70489aa75","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"matchaddposと違うのは「行が変わってもハイライトが追跡される」点みたいですね。\n\u003chttps://neovim.io/doc/user/api.html#nvim_buf_add_highlight()\u003e","ts":"1630463751.018700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5x8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14DBC91A-18C3-4D56-AB33-3FF0A1ADE40A","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"位置がわかるならvim.api.nvim_buf_add_highlightでいけるんですけどね(matchaddposと似たような感じ)","ts":"1630463143.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xzLXr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7951cc77-9b91-49bc-b350-18822a8045ff","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"やはりmatchaddが正解でしたか。ハイライトされるだけでもダブりを消しやすくなるのでもう少し調べてみます。ありがとうございます！","ts":"1630462957.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXrp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c5f570c-c3a8-4dc1-9b8a-70fb2833ea86","type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"matchaddでいけましたね\n```local all_options = vim.api.nvim_get_all_options_info()\n\nfor i, v in pairs(all_options) do\n  if v.was_set and vim.opt[i]:get() == v.default then\n    vim.notify(i .. \" is same as default value.\")\n    vim.fn.matchadd(\"Search\", ([[\\V%s]]):format(i))\n  end\nend```","ts":"1630462551.014300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F+H1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7156796b-0df7-47f7-8021-20d58f418a87","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そうですそうです！それがやりたいのですがmatchaddを使うといいのかなと。","ts":"1630462484.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9=3"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","text":"こういうことです？","ts":"1630461582.012200","files":[{"id":"F02CKJCHABH","created":1630461551,"timestamp":1630461551,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U02AJP5L75Z","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":46174,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH/image.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH/download/image.png","original_h":534,"original_w":467,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-a1a39a8163/image_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-a1a39a8163/image_80.png","thumb_160":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-a1a39a8163/image_160.png","thumb_360":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-a1a39a8163/image_360.png","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":315,"thumb_360_h":360,"thumb_480":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-a1a39a8163/image_480.png","thumb_480_w":420,"thumb_480_h":480,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/files/U02AJP5L75Z/F02CKJCHABH/image.png","permalink_public":"https://slack-files.com/T03C4RC8V-F02CKJCHABH-e241bf3ead","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":true,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"thumb_tiny":"AwAwACmiv9KXseKatSoqFfmYg/SmSRE8UhJNSPgNgHI+lRmgYlFFFMQ5acKatWokRoRnAJ70m7DSuVmFNpxxzg/jTKACiiimIeinBPGAPWlHSmrUgQhN+Rj60gGHr7U00/8AiyOlNZjnrQMbRRRTEf/Z","username":""}],"reactions":[{"name":"god","count":1,"users":["U022PB40WAF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VAbug"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77b44df4-9442-4ae3-95ef-af07248265dc","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"プラグイン化したら便利だろうか。","ts":"1630450354.012000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l6U0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c22c4a7-814c-467d-adc6-7ca1617409ae","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"```local all_options = vim.api.nvim_get_all_options_info()\n\nfor k, v in pairs(all_options) do\n    if v.was_set then\n        if vim.opt[k]:get() == v.default then\n            vim.notify(k .. \" is the same as default value.\")\n        end\n    end\nend```\nNeovimのデフォルト値と同じだったらオプション名を出力するコードだけど、できれば設定ファイル内にある該当部分をハイライトしたい。\nよく分からないからまだ手をつけられていないけど。","ts":"1630449945.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E6xAi"}]}]
